\"color: #008000;\"><strong>Important Dates</strong></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Application Begin : <b>01/06/2026</b></li>\n<li>Last Date for Apply Online : <span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><b>21/06/2026</b></span></li>\n<li>Pay Exam Fee Last Date : <b>21/06/2026</b></li>\n<li>Correction Date : <strong>24-25 June 2026</strong></li>\n<li>Exam Date : <b>As per Schedule.</b></li>\n<li>Admit Card Available<strong> : Before Exam</strong></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 39.5919%;\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"272\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><strong>Application Fee</strong></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>General (UR) / OBC : <b>1200/-</b></li>\n<li>EWS : <strong>1000/-</strong></li>\n<li>SC / ST : <b>1000/-</b></li>\n<li>Pay the Exam Fee Through Debit Card, Credit Card, Net Banking Only.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100.006%;\" colspan=\"11\" valign=\"top\" width=\"618\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><strong>Allahabad High Court RO, ARO, CA Notification 2026 : <span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\">Age Limit as on</span> <span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\">01/07/2026</span></strong></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Minimum Age : <b>21 Years.</b></li>\n<li>Maximum Age : <b>35 &nbsp;Years</b></li>\n<li>Age Relaxation Extra as per Allahabad High Court RO / ARO / CA Recruitment Rules.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100.006%;\" colspan=\"11\" valign=\"top\" width=\"618\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\">AHC RO, ARO, CA Recruitment 2026 : <span style=\"color: #008000;\">Vacancy Details Total : 543 Post </span></span></strong></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 22.5%;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"151\">\n<p align=\"center\"><b>Post Name</b></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 19.4118%;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"130\">\n<p align=\"center\"><b>Total Post</b></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 58.0945%;\" colspan=\"9\" valign=\"top\" width=\"337\">\n<p align=\"center\"><b>Allahabad High Court RO ARO CA Eligibility</b></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 22.5%;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"151\">\n<p align=\"center\">Review Officer</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 19.4118%;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"130\">\n<p align=\"center\">138</p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"9\" rowspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"337\">\n<ul>\n<li>Bachelor Degree in Any Stream with&nbsp; Degree / Diploma in Computer Science <b>OR</b> O Level <b>OR</b> CCC.</li>\n<li>English Computer Typing : 25 WPM</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 22.5%;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"151\">\n<p align=\"center\">Assistant Review Officer</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 19.4118%;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"130\">\n<p align=\"center\">380</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 22.5%;\">\n<p align=\"center\">Computer Assistant</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 19.4118%;\">\n<p align=\"center\">25</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100.006%;\" colspan=\"11\" valign=\"top\" width=\"618\">\n\n<ul>\n<li>Allahabad High Court AHC Assistant Review Officer &amp; Review Officer, Computer Assistant Recruitment 2026 Online Form Candidate &nbsp;Apply Between <strong>01 June 2026&nbsp; to 21 June 2026.</strong></li>\n<li>Candidate Read the Notification Before Apply the Recruitment Application Form in Allahabad HC Latest Career Jobs.</li>\n<li>Kindly Check and Collect the All Document – Eligibility, ID Proof, Address Details, Basic Details.</li>\n<li>Kindly Ready Scan Document Related to Recruitment Form – Photo, Sign, ID Proof, Etc.</li>\n<li>Before Submit the Application Form Must Check the Preview and All Column Carefully.</li>\n<li>If Candidate Required to Paying the Application Fee Must Submit. If You have Not the Required Application Fees Your Form is Not Completed.</li>\n<li>Take A Print Out of Final Submitted Form.</li>\n<li>For the latest updates on Sarkari Result, admit card, answer key, and result, always visit SarkariResult.com, the official website for Sarkari Result in India (Since 2012).</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100.006%;\" colspan=\"11\" valign=\"top\" width=\"618\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><strong>Interested Candidate Can Read the Full Notification Before Apply Online.</strong></span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100.006%;\" colspan=\"11\" valign=\"top\" width=\"618\">\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 52.175%;\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"328\">\n\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 47.8313%;\" colspan=\"7\" valign=\"top\" width=\"290\">\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100.006%;\" colspan=\"11\" valign=\"top\" width=\"618\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><strong>Some Useful Important Links</strong></span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"330\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><strong>Apply Online</strong></span></h2>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"6\" valign=\"top\" width=\"288\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><strong><a href=\"https://examinationservices.nic.in/recsys2026/root/Home.aspx?enc=Ei4cajBkK1gZSfgr53ImFdjoojMEdElwjdIyoUFL7zFG0/iUe3TLUpr8BDubooUX\">Click Here</a></strong></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"5\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><strong>How to Fill Form (Video Hindi)</strong></span></h2>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"6\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><a title=\"AHC RO ARO Form Kaise Bhare 2026\" href=\"https://tinyurl.com/28uxfpxv\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"5\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><strong>Download Syllabus</strong></span></h2>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"6\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 56.3302%;\" colspan=\"5\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><strong>Download Detailed Notification</strong></span></h2>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 43.6761%;\" colspan=\"6\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><strong><a href=\"https://cdnbbsr.s3waas.gov.in/s388a839f2f6f1427879fc33ee4acf4f66/uploads/2026/06/202606011285584131.pdf\">Click Here</a></strong></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 56.3302%;\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"330\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><strong>Download Short Notice</strong></span></h2>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 43.6761%;\" colspan=\"6\" valign=\"top\" width=\"288\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><strong></strong></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 56.3302%;\" colspan=\"5\" valign=\"top\" width=\"330\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><strong>Official Website</strong></span></h2>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 43.6761%;\" colspan=\"6\" valign=\"top\" width=\"288\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><a title=\"Allahabad High Court Official Website\" href=\"https://www.allahabadhighcourt.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Allahabad High Court Official Website</strong></a></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-6da1cb96\">\n\n<h3 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-325acb59\"><span class=\"gb-icon\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" role=\"img\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M207.029 381.476L12.686 187.132c-9.373-9.373-9.373-24.569 0-33.941l22.667-22.667c9.357-9.357 24.522-9.375 33.901-.04L224 284.505l154.745-154.021c9.379-9.335 24.544-9.317 33.901.04l22.667 22.667c9.373 9.373 9.373 24.569 0 33.941L240.971 381.476c-9.373 9.372-24.569 9.372-33.942 0z\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"gb-headline-text\"><strong><em>Frequently Asked Questions</em></strong></span></h3>\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-97950a91 gb-headline-text\"><h5 style=\"text-align: left;\" data-section-id=\"1nlecbm\" data-start=\"39\" data-end=\"96\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">1. Allahabad High Court RO / ARO / CA Online Form 2026 start?</span></strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\" data-start=\"97\" data-end=\"178\">The online application process for Allahabad High Court Review Officer (RO), Assistant Review Officer (ARO), and Computer Assistant (CA) Recruitment 2026 started on <strong data-start=\"439\" data-end=\"455\">01 June 2026</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left;\" data-section-id=\"1dih1sd\" data-start=\"307\" data-end=\"359\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><strong>2. Pay Examination Fee Last Date ?</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\" data-start=\"360\" data-end=\"433\">Candidates can pay the application fee up to <strong data-start=\"742\" data-end=\"758\">21 June 2026</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left;\" data-section-id=\"kyy6a2\" data-start=\"180\" data-end=\"221\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><strong>3. Last date to apply online for Allahabad High Court RO / ARO / CA Recruitment 2026?</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\" data-start=\"222\" data-end=\"305\">The last date to submit the online application form is <strong data-start=\"618\" data-end=\"634\">21 June 2026</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left;\" data-section-id=\"1e84k3r\" data-start=\"435\" data-end=\"474\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">4. Allahabad High Court RO / ARO / CA Exam Date ?</span></strong></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\" data-start=\"475\" data-end=\"553\">The examination will be conducted <strong data-start=\"880\" data-end=\"941\">as per the schedule announced by the Allahabad High Court</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left;\" data-section-id=\"o0mtqe\" data-start=\"555\" data-end=\"592\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>5. Allahabad High Court RO / ARO / CA Exam Mode?</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\" data-start=\"593\" data-end=\"655\">The examination will be conducted in <strong data-start=\"1063\" data-end=\"1097\">Computer Based Test (CBT) mode</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left;\" data-section-id=\"o0mtqe\" data-start=\"555\" data-end=\"592\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>6. How to Apply Allahabad High Court RO / ARO / CA Recruitment Online Form 2026?</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\" data-start=\"593\" data-end=\"655\">Candidates can apply online through the official recruitment link available on <strong data-start=\"1262\" data-end=\"1334\">SarkariResult.com (Since 2012) – Official Website of Sarkari Result®</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<figure id=\"attachment_22089\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-22089\" style=\"width: 1467px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-22089\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201477%20962'%3E%3C/svg%3E\" alt=\"Allahabad HC RO ARO CA Recruitment 2026 Sarkari Result\" width=\"1477\" height=\"962\" data-lazy-srcset=\"https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/ahcroaroca2026.png 1477w, https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/ahcroaroca2026-300x195.png 300w, https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/ahcroaroca2026-1024x667.png 1024w, https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/ahcroaroca2026-768x500.png 768w\" data-lazy-sizes=\"(max-width: 1477px) 100vw, 1477px\" data-lazy-src=\"https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/ahcroaroca2026.png\"><noscript><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-22089\" src=\"https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/ahcroaroca2026.png\" alt=\"Allahabad HC RO ARO CA Recruitment 2026 Sarkari Result\" width=\"1477\" height=\"962\" srcset=\"https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/ahcroaroca2026.png 1477w, https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/ahcroaroca2026-300x195.png 300w, https://www.sar